{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VxqiVJ87aTR1C8rGYzvz9z","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have comprehensive information. Let me create a final summary with all the key findings:\n\n## Summary Report: Agent Progress Probe - File Search Results\n\nBased on my thorough search of `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/projects/agent_progress_probe`, here are the complete findings:\n\n### 1. EARLY TERMINATION SIMULATION SCRIPTS\n\n**Location**: `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/projects/agent_progress_probe/early_termination_sim.py`\n- **Size**: 502 lines\n- **Purpose**: D072 Early Termination Simulation\n- **Key Parameters**:\n  - `K_VALUES = [1, 2, 3, 5, 7, 10]` (consecutive stagnation threshold for termination)\n  - Trains 3-LF GB and 2-LF RF models on SWE conf>=2 data\n  - Evaluates on OH conf>=2 windows (N=~6,122)\n  - Outputs: `artifacts/d072/early_termination_sim.json`\n- **Models Simulated**: 3lf_gb, 2lf_rf, oracle, random\n- **Metrics**: precision, recall, compute_saved, false_termination_rate for each k value\n\n### 2. PARETO CURVE SCRIPTS\n\n**Location**: `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/projects/agent_progress_probe/pareto_curve.py`\n- **Size**: 123 lines\n- **Purpose**: Generate Pareto curve (Compute Saved % vs Task Success Preserved %)\n- **Input Data**: `artifacts/d072/early_termination_sim.json`\n- **Output**: `artifacts/d072/pareto_curve.pdf` and `artifacts/d072/pareto_curve.png`\n- **K values tracked**: [1, 2, 3, 5, 7, 10]\n- **Models**: 3-LF GB, 2-LF RF, Oracle, Random with distinct line styles\n\n### 3. 2-LF CROSS-AGENT EVALUATION\n\n**Location**: `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/projects/agent_progress_probe/exp_2lf_cross_agent.py`\n- **Purpose**: 2-LF (file_diff + cmd_rep) Cross-Agent Transfer evaluation\n- **Key Parameters**:\n  - Training: SWE 2-LF conf>=2 windows\n  - Evaluation: OpenHands conf>=2 windows\n  - Models: Gradient Boosting (GB) and Random Forest (RF)\n  - Feature extraction: 30-dimensional feature vectors\n- **Comparisons**:\n  1. RF vs Probe in-domain (SWE, N=1,824)\n  2. GB vs Probe zero-shot cross-agent (OH, N=6,122)\n  3. GB vs Probe fine-tuned cross-agent (OH, N=6,122)\n- **Outputs**: Cross-agent F1 scores, macro_f1, f1_stag, f1_prog per scope\n\n**Related Log Files**:\n- `logs/workers/worker_experiment_e1-2lf-crossagent_20260515T134420_result.json`\n- `logs/workers/worker_experiment_e1-2lf-crossagent_20260515T134420.log`\n\n### 4. MATCHED-SCOPE EVALUATION SCRIPTS\n\n**Location**: `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/projects/agent_progress_probe/bootstrap_table2_matched.py`\n- **Purpose**: Paired bootstrap test for matched-scope comparison\n- **Test Sets**: \n  - Comparison 1: SWE conf>=2 test (N=1,824)\n  - Comparison 2 & 3: OH conf>=2 test (N=6,122)\n- **Method**: Bootstrap CI with McNemar test\n- **Related Artifacts**:\n  - `artifacts/bootstrap_table2_matched.json`\n  - `artifacts/_project/data/bootstrap_table2_matched.json`\n\n**Prevalence-Matched Ablation**:\n- `artifacts/prevalence-matched-ablation/report/prevalence_matched_ablation_results.json`\n- Tests removal of cmd_rep LF\n- Shows training data reduction from 43K to 4K windows\n- Result: cmd_rep contribution is primarily coverage (-29.4pp delta when removed, p≈0)\n\n### 5. D072 DIRECTORY CONTENTS\n\n**Location**: `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/projects/agent_progress_probe/artifacts/d072/`\n\nFiles:\n- `pareto_curve.pdf` (19 KB) - Published visualization\n- `pareto_curve.png` (159 KB) - Published visualization  \n- `compute_waste_audit.json` (1.1 MB) - Complete compute waste analysis\n- `chart/` subdirectory (contains pareto_curve.png duplicate)\n\n**Compute Waste Audit Summary** (from JSON):\n- Total trajectories: 5,000\n- Trajectories with stagnation: 863 (17.3%)\n- Mean tail ratio: 0.3847 (38.47% of steps wasted after stagnation onset)\n- Median tail ratio: 0.2203 (22.03%)