p CI for cross-agent metrics\n- `worker_code_cross-agent-structural-baseline_20260514T170555` - Structural baseline code\n\n### 9. PRELIMINARY RESULTS\n\n**Window Size Ablation** (Most Relevant):\n- Optimal window size: **k=5** (10 steps) with macro_f1=0.9309\n- Non-monotonic trend confirms k parameter sensitivity\n- Used with stride=2 for all subsequent evaluations (STRIDE_PAIRS=2)\n\n**2-LF vs 3-LF Labels**:\n- 2-LF (file_diff + cmd_rep) trained on SWE: ~40K conf>=2 windows\n- 3-LF baseline: ~43K conf>=2 windows\n- Cross-agent transfer: 2-LF RF and 3-LF GB models both evaluated on OH test set\n\n**Compute Waste**:\n- Mean stagnation tail: 38.47% of steps wasted after onset\n- ~17% of trajectories exhibit detectable stagnation\n- Early termination at k=5 (5-consecutive stagnation windows) selected as primary threshold\n\n**CLAUDE.md Location**: `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/projects/agent_progress_probe/.claude/CLAUDE.md`\n- Contains worker setup standards and project configuration guidance\n- References to remote server paths at `/root/autodl-tmp/agent_progress_probe`"}],"totalDurationMs":71454,"totalTokens":82994,"totalToolUseCount":47,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7446,"cache_read_input_tokens":73136,"output_tokens":2406,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":7446},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":6,"output_tokens":2406,"cache_read_input_tokens":73136,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7446,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":7446,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":10,"searchCount":7,"bashCount":30,"editFileCount":0,"linesAdded":0,"linesRemoved":0,"otherToolCount":0}}}
