{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Kdi9293AoqLGPjDyxrcrBH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01PXXfjKxZ8A3YrFYbRbycGB","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat logs/workers/worker_experiment_e2-e4-gb-scope-gold_20260515T140702.log | python3 -c \"\nimport json, sys\n# Find the last assistant message with actual results\ncontent = sys.stdin.read()\nlines = content.strip().split('\\n')\nresults = []\nfor line in lines:\n    try:\n        d = json.loads(line)\n        if d.get('type') == 'assistant':\n            msg = d.get('message', {})\n            for c in msg.get('content', []):\n                if c.get('type') == 'text':\n                    results.append(c['text'])\n    except: pass\n# Print last result text\nif results:\n    for r in results[-3:]:\n        print(r[:3000])\n        print('---')\n\" 2>/dev/null\n","description":"Extract e2-e4 results from log"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2763,"cache_read_input_tokens":144071,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2763},"output_tokens":59,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b07a11b6-c8ab-4699-acee-a0e26907aaa6","uuid":"5918f87a-d2e1-4b05-9988-8a88ca74e11f"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PXXfjKxZ8A3YrFYbRbycGB","type":"tool_result","content":"E4 results already exist in the paper. Let me read the existing bootstrap results for E2.\n---\nBoth results already exist. Let me compile the findings.\n---\nBoth experiments have already been run. Results are in `artifacts/bootstrap_table2_matched.json` (E2) and `docs/paper/sections/appendix.tex` Table 12 (E4).\n\n---\n\n## E2: GB on OH Matched-Scope Test Split (N=6,122)\n\n| Model | Scope | N | Macro-F1 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **Structural GB** | OH conf≥2 test split | 6,122 | **0.9929** |\n| Probe zero-shot | OH conf≥2 test split | 6,122 | 0.5984 |\n| Probe fine-tuned | OH conf≥2 test split | 6,122 | 0.9763 |\n\n**Delta**: GB − Probe zero-shot = **+39.44pp** (95% CI [37.86, 41.04], p=0.0, B=10K)\n\n**Key finding**: On the exact same OH conf≥2 test split, GB (0.9929) massively outperforms Probe zero-shot (0.5984). Note that GB on this conf≥2 test split (0.9929) is actually *higher* than the Table 2 all-OH number (0.9674), because conf≥2 windows are easier to classify. GB also exceeds Probe fine-tuned (0.9763) by +1.65pp (p=0.0).\n\n---\n\n## E4: GB on SWE-Only Gold Subset (Set B)\n\n| Model | Scope | N | Macro-F1 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **Structural GB** | SWE-only | ~335 | **0.877** |\n| TWV Probe | SWE-only | ~335 | 0.854 |\n| GRU Probe | SWE-only | ~335 | 0.790 |\n| Structural GB | All | 505 | 0.839 |\n| MV Labels | All | 505 | 0.798 |\n\n**Delta**: GB − TWV Probe (scope-matched) = **+2.3pp** (p=0.14, not significant)\n\n**Key finding**: On the SWE-only subset where Probe models can be evaluated, GB (0.877) exceeds TWV Probe (0.854). TWV Probe's apparent top ranking in the overall table (0.854 vs GB 0.839) is a **scope artifact** — TWV Probe only evaluates easy SWE-only windows while GB's 0.839 includes harder OH windows that drag the average down. Scope-matched, GB wins, though the difference is not statistically significant at α=0.05.\n\n---\n\n## Summary\n\n| Comparison | Scope | GB | Competitor | Delta |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| E2: GB vs Probe ZS | OH conf≥2 test (N=6,122) | 0.9929 | 0.5984 | **+39.4pp** |\n| E2: GB vs Probe FT | OH conf≥2 test (N=6,122) | 0.9929 | 0.9763 | +1.7pp |\n| E4: GB vs TWV Probe | SWE-only gold (N≈335) | 0.877 | 0.854 | +2.3pp |\n| E4: GB vs MV | All gold (N=505) | 0.839 | 0.798 | +4.2pp |\n\nBoth scope-matched comparisons confirm GB dominance. The Probe zero-shot gap (+39.4pp) is the headline cross-agent result. The TWV Probe \"advantage\" in gold evaluation was purely a scope artifact.\n---","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b07a11b6-c8ab-4699-acee-a0e26907aaa6","uuid":"225c9410-cac7-4536-b84a-746b0202c894","timestamp":"2026-05-15T14:48:04.088Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"E4 results already exist in the paper. Let me read the existing bootstrap results for E2.\n---\nBoth results already exist. Let me compile the findings.\n---\nBoth experiments have already been run. Results are in `artifacts/bootstrap_table2_matched.json` (E2) and `docs/paper/sections/appendix.tex` Table 12 (E4).\n\n---\n\n## E2: GB on OH Matched-Scope Test Split (N=6,122)\n\n| Model | Scope | N | Macro-F1 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **Structural GB** | OH conf≥2 test split | 6,122 | **0.9929** |\n| Probe zero-shot | OH conf≥2 test split | 6,122 | 0.5984 |\n| Probe fine-tuned | OH conf≥2 test split | 6,122 | 0.9763 |\n\n**Delta**: GB − Probe zero-shot = **+39.44pp** (95% CI [37.86, 41.04], p=0.0, B=10K)\n\n**Key finding**: On the exact same OH conf≥2 test split, GB (0.9929) massively outperforms Probe zero-shot (0.5984). Note that GB on this conf≥2 test split (0.9929) is actually *higher* than the Table 2 all-OH number (0.9674), because conf≥2 windows are easier to classify. GB also exceeds Probe fine-tuned (0.9763) by +1.65pp (p=0.0).\n\n---\n\n## E4: GB on SWE-Only Gold Subset (Set B)\n\n| Model | Scope | N | Macro-F1 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **Structural GB** | SWE-only | ~335 | **0.877** |\n| TWV Probe | SWE-only | ~335 | 0.854 |\n| GRU Probe | SWE-only | ~335 | 0.790 |\n| Structural GB | All | 505 | 0.839 |\n| MV Labels | All | 505 | 0.798 |\n\n**Delta**: GB − TWV Probe (scope-matched) = **+2.3pp** (p=0.14, not significant)\n\n**Key finding**: On the SWE-only subset where Probe models can be evaluated, GB (0.877) exceeds TWV Probe (0.854). TWV Probe's apparent top ranking in the overall table (0.854 vs GB 0.839) is a **scope artifact** — TWV Probe only evaluates easy SWE-only windows while GB's 0.839 includes harder OH windows that drag the average down. Scope-matched, GB wins, though the difference is not statistically significant at α=0.05.\n\n---\n\n## Summary\n\n| Comparison | Scope | GB | Competitor | Delta |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| E2: GB vs Probe ZS | OH conf≥2 test (N=6,122) | 0.9929 | 0.5984 | **+39.4pp** |\n| E2: GB vs Probe FT | OH conf≥2 test (N=6,122) | 0.9929 | 0.9763 | +1.7pp |\n| E4: GB vs TWV Probe | SWE-only gold (N≈335) | 0.877 | 0.854 | +2.3pp |\n| E4: GB vs MV | All gold (N=505) | 0.839 | 0.798 | +4.2pp |\n\nBoth scope-matched comparisons confirm GB dominance. The Probe zero-shot gap (+39.4pp) is the headline cross-agent result. The TWV Probe \"advantage\" in gold evaluation was purely a scope artifact.\n---","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01DxbwnRVkd5N4bHTcFkQZSA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Excellent! Now I have the actual e2 and e4 results:\n\n**E2 (matched-scope)**: DONE\n- GB 0.9929 vs Probe 0.5984, delta +39.44pp, CI [37.86, 41.04], p=0.0\n- GB vs Probe fine-tuned: 0.9929 vs 0.9763, delta +1.65pp\n\n**E4 (GB on SWE gold)**: DONE  \n- GB SWE-only: 0.877\n\n\n- TWV Probe SWE-only: 0.854, so GB outperforms by 2.3pp but it's not statistically significant\n- GB all gold: 0.839, MV all gold: 0.798\n\nThe e4-gb-swe-gold result of 0.877 lands right at the upper boundary of the best tier range. Now I'm checking what other experiment logs we have available—compute-waste-audit is partially done with SWE complete but OH still missing, and early-termination-simulation has a script ready.\n\nLooking at the full experiment status: 2lf-cross-agent and matched-scope-eval are both finished with strong results, cost-effectiveness-pareto and early-termination-simulation are script-ready but haven't run yet, and llm-on-oh doesn't have any script or results. For the YAML output, I'll use actual results where we have them, fill in partial results with predictions for compute-waste-audit, and generate predictions for the remaining experiments.\n\nNow I'm working through the predictions for compute-waste-audit's OH portion. The SWE results show 11.8% overall waste with 37.8% per-tail-trajectory waste, and I'm estimating OH would follow similar patterns but adjusted for its different agent architecture—with a lower stagnation rate of 21.45% compared to SWE's 28.46%, fewer trajectories with tails at around 14%, and an overall waste estimate of about 10% of total compute. The weighted per-trajectory tail ratio comes out to roughly 40%.\n\nFor the early-termination-simulation results, I'm analyzing the performance of different models across various k values. The 3lf_gb model performs near-perfectly with an accuracy of 0.9919 on OH confidence scores of 2 or higher, while 2lf_rf is also very strong at 0.978. Looking at 3lf_gb specifically, there's a clear tradeoff as k increases—at k=1 I get the most compute saved at 0.29 with high recall of 0.95 but lower precision at 0.87, while at k=5 precision climbs to 0.98 but saved compute drops to 0.13 and recall falls to 0.57.\n\nThe k=1 setting saves 29% of compute, which fits within the target range of 25-40%, and preserves around 93-94% of task success—just barely meeting the 93-98% threshold. For the paper, k=1 or k=2 would represent the best Pareto-optimal operating points. But I'm realizing I need to reconsider what \"false termination\" actually means in this simulation—it's not the same as terminating a resolved trajectory, since a trajectory could have its last high-confidence window showing progress but still be unresolved.\n\nSince the simulation doesn't track actual resolved/unresolved status, I'll use the false termination rate as a proxy for task success preserved and provide all the metrics (precision, recall, compute saved, false termination rate) in the YAML output. I'm also double-checking the stagnation tail compute percentage against the tier definition of 35-55%, and the actual SWE data shows 37.8% for trajectories with tails and 11.8% overall waste, both of which align with expectations.\n\nThe key insight for the paper is framing this as \"37.8% of compute in stagnating trajectories is wasted\" rather than \"11.8% of all compute,\" since the strict stagnation onset definition only captures 17.3% of SWE trajectories but represents the right subset for the compute waste story. The early termination simulation then demonstrates that even a practical detector can save significant compute without requiring the strict tail criteria.\n\nWriting the YAML output now...\n\nI'm organizing the experiments by data type: actual numbers for compute-waste-audit (SWE data with OH predictions), early-termination-simulation and cost-effectiveness-pareto (both predicted), 2lf-cross-agent, matched-scope-eval, and e4-gb-swe-gold (all actual), plus llm-on-oh (predicted).","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1245,"cache_read_input_tokens":146834,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1245},"output_tokens":36,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b07a11b6-c8ab-4699-acee-a0e26907aaa6","uuid":"675ad30c-ab94-498d-8fbc-b83df55fbc59"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01DxbwnRVkd5N4bHTcFkQZSA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I have all the data I need. Let me compile the comprehensive predictions, using actual results where experiments have already run.\n\n```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Claim 4 全面兑现：stagnating 轨迹 ~40% compute 浪费于 stagnation tail，\n  early termination 在 k=2 节省 ~24% compute 同时保留 ~97% task success，\n  Pareto 前沿 AUC ≈ 0.84 远超 random。Claim 1 确认实验全部复现 headline：\n  matched-scope +39.4pp（CI [37.86, 41.04]）、2-LF cross-agent RF 0.978（-1.8pp）。\n  Gold SWE 验证 GB 0.877 scope-matched 胜出。LLM cross-agent 仍落后 ~21pp。\n  4 claims 以 detect → analyze → (negative) → intervene 递进，8 页足够。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  #=================================================================\n  # 1. COMPUTE WASTE AUDIT (SWE actual / OH predicted)\n  #=================================================================\n  - name: compute-waste-audit\n    plan_id: compute-waste-audit\n    description: >\n      回溯分析全量轨迹 stagnation tail，量化 step/token 浪费。\n      Stagnation onset 定义：最早的 conf≥2 窗口使得此后所有 conf≥2 窗口均为 stagnation。\n    expected_results:\n      swe_agent_ACTUAL:\n        n_trajectories: 5000\n        n_with_tail: 863\n        pct_with_tail: 17.3\n        mean_tail_ratio: 0.3847\n        median_tail_ratio: 0.2203\n        mean_tail_steps: 36.7\n        median_tail_steps: 13\n        overall_compute_waste_pct: 11.8\n        tail_traj_mean_total_steps: 96.9\n        non_tail_traj_mean_total_steps: 44.5\n        tail_distribution_histogram:\n          \"0.0-0.1\": 114\n          \"0.1-0.2\": 290\n          \"0.2-0.3\": 122\n          \"0.3-0.4\": 36\n          \"0.4-0.5\": 34\n          \"0.5-0.6\": 21\n          \"0.6-0.7\": 29\n          \"0.7-0.8\": 36\n          \"0.8-0.9\": 77\n          \"0.9-1.0\": 104\n      openhands_PREDICTED:\n        n_trajectories: 3409\n        n_with_tail: 480\n        pct_with_tail: 14.1\n        mean_tail_ratio: 0.42\n        median_tail_ratio: 0.28\n        overall_compute_waste_pct: 10.2\n      combined:\n        per_trajectory_tail_ratio_mean: 0.40\n        per_trajectory_tail_ratio_ci95: [0.37, 0.43]\n        overall_waste_pct: 11.1\n    result_rationale: >\n      SWE-Agent 数据为实际结果（artifacts/d072/compute_waste_audit.json）。\n      严格定义（ALL subsequent conf≥2 windows = stagnation）导致仅 17.3% 轨迹\n      有 tail。但这些轨迹平均 96.9 步（vs non-tail 44.5 步），tail 占其自身\n      compute 的 38.47%。分布明显双峰：大量短 tail（10-20%）+ 一个 90-100% \n      的峰（104 条轨迹几乎全程 stagnation）。Overall 11.8% 因为大量无 tail \n      轨迹稀释了分母。\n      \n      OH 预测略低因为：(1) OH stag_rate 低于 SWE（21.45% vs 28.46%），严格\n      定义下更少轨迹形成完整 stagnation tail；(2) OH 的 cmd_rep LF 仅 5.39% \n      fire rate → conf≥2 窗口更少 → 严格定义更难满足。但 OH tail 轨迹的 \n      per-trajectory ratio 预测更高（0.42 vs 0.38），因为 OH 中一旦形成 tail，\n      agent 的 browser-based action space 使其更难恢复。\n      \n      Combined per-trajectory tail ratio ~0.40 落在 best-tier [0.35, 0.55]。\n      Paper headline: \"Among trajectories exhibiting terminal stagnation, ~40% \n      of their compute is consumed after stagnation onset.\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Stagnation Tail Compute Waste\"\n        description: >\n          Rows: SWE-Agent, OpenHands, Combined。\n          Columns: N_traj, N_with_tail (%), Mean_tail_ratio, Median, \n          Overall_waste_%, Tail_traj_mean_steps。\n      - name: \"Table: Tail by Trajectory Length Quartile\"\n        description: >\n          Rows: Short(≤30), Medium(31-60), Long(>60)。\n          Columns: N_traj, Pct_with_tail, Mean_tail_ratio。\n          SWE actual: short 2089 (41.8%), medium 1425, long 1486。\n    figures_description:\n      - name: \"Figure: Stagnation Tail Distribution\"\n        description: >\n          Histogram (10 bins, 0-1)。双峰：0.1-0.2 峰（290 条）+ \n          0.9-1.0 峰（104 条）。标注 mean=0.38 和 median=0.22 垂线。\n      - name: \"Figure: Cumulative Compute Waste\"\n        description: >\n          X: trajectories sorted by tail length, Y: cumulative waste %。\n          显示 top 267 条 (>50% tail) 贡献 9.1% overall waste（78% of total waste）。\n    analysis: >\n      Strict definition 给出保守下界（11.8% overall）。Paper 的 headline 使用 \n      per-trajectory metric（~40%），更准确反映 stagnating agent 的浪费程度。\n      Early termination simulation 使用更宽松的 detector-based 定义，可恢复\n      更多 compute——因为 detector 不需要 ALL subsequent windows 是 stagnation，\n      仅需 k consecutive predictions。\n\n  #=================================================================\n  # 2. EARLY TERMINATION SIMULATION (PREDICTED)\n  #=================================================================\n  - name: early-termination-simulation\n    plan_id: early-termination-simulation\n    description: >\n      在 OH conf≥2 cross-agent 场景模拟 k-consecutive-stagnation early stopping。\n      Train: SWE 3-LF GB (canonical HP) + SWE 2-LF RF。\n      Eval: OH conf≥2 windows grouped by trajectory。\n      Models: 3lf_gb, 2lf_rf, oracle, random。K ∈ {1,2,3,5,7,10}。\n    expected_results:\n      eval_set:\n        oh_conf2_windows: 43376\n        oh_trajectories: ~3400\n        stag_prevalence: 0.193\n      3lf_gb:\n        k1:\n          precision: 0.87\n          recall: 0.95\n          compute_saved: 0.29\n          false_termination_rate: 0.13\n          n_terminated: ~2950\n        k2:\n          precision: 0.93\n          recall: 0.86\n          compute_saved: 0.24\n          false_termination_rate: 0.07\n          n_terminated: ~2100\n        k3:\n          precision: 0.96\n          recall: 0.76\n          compute_saved: 0.19\n          false_termination_rate: 0.04\n          n_terminated: ~1450\n        k5:\n          precision: 0.98\n          recall: 0.57\n          compute_saved: 0.13\n          false_termination_rate: 0.02\n          n_terminated: ~850\n        k7:\n          precision: 0.99\n          recall: 0.42\n          compute_saved: 0.09\n          false_termination_rate: 0.01\n          n_terminated: ~550\n        k10:\n          precision: 0.99\n          recall: 0.27\n          compute_saved: 0.06\n          false_termination_rate: 0.01\n          n_terminated: ~320\n      2lf_rf:\n        k1:\n          precision: 0.85\n          recall: 0.93\n          compute_saved: 0.26\n          false_termination_rate: 0.15\n        k2:\n          precision: 0.91\n          recall: 0.84\n          compute_saved: 0.21\n          false_termination_rate: 0.09\n        k3:\n          precision: 0.94\n          recall: 0.73\n          compute_saved: 0.17\n          false_termination_rate: 0.06\n        k5:\n          precision: 0.97\n          recall: 0.53\n          compute_saved: 0.11\n          false_termination_rate: 0.03\n        k7:\n          precision: 0.98\n          recall: 0.39\n          compute_saved: 0.08\n          false_termination_rate: 0.02\n        k10:\n          precision: 0.99\n          recall: 0.24\n          compute_saved: 0.05\n          false_termination_rate: 0.01\n      oracle:\n        k1:\n          precision: 1.00\n          recall: 1.00\n          compute_saved: 0.35\n          false_termination_rate: 0.00\n        k3:\n          precision: 1.00\n          recall: 0.85\n          compute_saved: 0.27\n          false_termination_rate: 0.00\n        k5:\n          precision: 1.00\n          recall: 0.65\n          compute_saved: 0.20\n          false_termination_rate: 0.00\n      random:\n        k1:\n          precision: 0.31\n          recall: 0.95\n          compute_saved: 0.27\n          false_termination_rate: 0.69\n        k3:\n          precision: 0.41\n          recall: 0.21\n          compute_saved: 0.04\n          false_termination_rate: 0.59\n        k5:\n          precision: 0.48\n          recall: 0.06\n          compute_saved: 0.01\n          false_termination_rate: 0.52\n      highlighted_operating_points:\n        best_savings: {model: 3lf_gb, k: 1, saved: \"29%\", success: \"~93%\"}\n        balanced: {model: 3lf_gb, k: 2, saved: \"24%\", success: \"~97%\"}\n        deployable: {model: 2lf_rf, k: 2, saved: \"21%\", success: \"~96%\"}\n        conservative: {model: 3lf_gb, k: 5, saved: \"13%\", success: \"~99%\"}\n    result_rationale: >\n      核心逻辑：3-LF GB 在 OH conf≥2 上 macro_f1=0.9919，per-window 精度和\n      召回均 ~99%。但 early termination 的 compute_saved 受限于三个因素：\n      \n      (1) Stagnation 在轨迹中集中在后半段。从 SWE 数据看，stagnation 主要出现\n      在 trajectory 的 late segment（59% of test windows）。detector 在首次 \n      stagnation 处触发终止，但首次 stagnation 往往已在轨迹 60-70% 处，\n      剩余可节省的 compute 仅 30-40%。\n      \n      (2) Conf≥2 窗口是所有窗口的子集。OH 有 150652 total windows 但只有 43376 \n      conf≥2。Simulation 只在 conf≥2 窗口上做预测，两个 conf≥2 窗口之间可能间隔\n      多步——这增加了 detection delay。\n      \n      (3) K-consecutive threshold 引入 delay。k=1 最快响应但 false termination \n      高（13%）；k=3 精度 96% 但 recall 降到 76%（短 tail 被漏掉）。\n      \n      3lf_gb vs 2lf_rf 差距来自 2-LF RF 的 cross-agent F1 (0.978 vs 0.992)——\n      per-window 误差更高导致每个 k 值的 savings 低 3-5pp。\n      \n      Oracle 在 k=1 仅节省 35%（非 100%），因为 oracle 也受限于 stagnation 在\n      轨迹中的位置——stagnation onset 较晚意味着即使完美检测也无法节省太多。\n      \n      Random baseline 在 k≥3 时崩溃（compute_saved 降到 <5%）因为随机预测\n      很难连续 k 次正确预测 stagnation。\n      \n      Best-tier range [25, 40] 对应 k=1 的 3lf_gb (29%)。Task success preserved \n      ~93%（从 false termination rate 推导：13% of terminated are false, \n      terminated ≈ 87% of trajectories, 但 resolved 轨迹 stagnation 极少 → \n      大部分 false termination 落在 unresolved trajectories 上，resolved \n      仅 ~6-7% 被误杀 → task_success ≈ 93%）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Early Termination Operating Points\"\n        description: >\n          Panel A: 3lf_gb sweep (k=1..10)。Panel B: 2lf_rf sweep。\n          Panel C: Oracle + Random reference。\n          Columns: k, Precision, Recall, Compute_Saved, FalseTermRate。\n          k=2 行加粗为 recommended balanced point。\n    figures_description:\n      - name: \"Figure: Trade-off Curve\"\n        description: >\n          X: k value, Y-left: Compute Saved (%), Y-right: Precision。\n          两条曲线交叉显示 savings-precision trade-off。\n          标注 k=2 为 sweet spot。\n    analysis: >\n      3lf_gb k=1-2 给出 24-29% savings，2lf_rf 给出 21-26%。\n      Savings 低于 stagnation tail ratio (40%) 的原因已被量化：detection delay \n      + stagnation 后期集中 + conf≥2 sparse coverage。Paper 可用 \n      \"conservative lower bound\" framing：真实部署中 freed compute 可重新分配\n      给新 attempt，实际收益更大。\n\n  #=================================================================\n  # 3. COST-EFFECTIVENESS PARETO (PREDICTED, derived from #2)\n  #=================================================================\n  - name: cost-effectiveness-pareto\n    plan_id: cost-effectiveness-pareto\n    description: >\n      综合 early termination 结果生成 Pareto 前沿。\n      X: compute saved (%), Y: 1 - false_termination_rate (proxy for task success)。\n      Four curves: 3lf_gb, 2lf_rf, oracle, random。\n    expected_results:\n      pareto_auc_normalized: 0.84\n      structural_gb_auc: 0.86\n      oracle_auc: 0.97\n      random_auc: 0.52\n      key_observation: >\n        3lf_gb 曲线在 k≥5 接近 oracle（<3pp gap），在 k=1-2 有明显 gap\n        （false termination 拉低 success）。2lf_rf 曲线整体在 3lf_gb 下方\n        2-4pp 但保持相似形状。Random 在 k≥3 后崩溃（几乎不节省 compute）。\n      dominance:\n        structural_dominates_random: true\n        structural_within_5pct_oracle_at_k_ge5: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Pareto AUC normalized = structural_AUC / oracle_AUC。\n      3lf_gb 在多数 operating range 接近 oracle 因为其 per-window 精度极高\n      （0.9919 macro_f1）。AUC 0.84 意味着 structural detector 捕获了 oracle \n      可达性能的 84%——对于一个 <5ms/window 的轻量方法而言非常有效。\n      Random baseline 的 AUC 仅 0.52（略高于对角线）因为它在 k=1 时通过\n      暴力终止可以节省一些 compute，但代价是极高的 false termination。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Pareto Operating Points\"\n        description: >\n          Key operating points: max savings, balanced, conservative \n          for each method。Bottom row: AUC summary。\n    figures_description:\n      - name: \"Figure: Cost-Effectiveness Pareto Frontier (论文 main figure)\"\n        description: >\n          X: Compute Saved (%), Y: 1 - False Termination Rate (%)。\n          四条曲线。3lf_gb (blue solid) 和 2lf_rf (blue dashed) 紧贴 \n          Oracle (green dotted)，远离 Random (gray dashed)。\n          每个 k 值标注为点。阴影区标注 \"deployment-viable region\"\n          (saved>15%, FTR<10%)。已生成 PDF/PNG 在 artifacts/d072/。\n    analysis: >\n      Pareto frontier 是 Claim 4 的核心 visualization。它直观展示\n      structural detector 的 deployment value——在整个 operating range \n      严格优于 random，在保守端接近 oracle。2lf_rf (deployable, no privileged\n      info) 与 3lf_gb 差距仅 3-5pp，证明 early termination 无需 outcome \n      information 即可有效部署。\n\n  #=================================================================\n  # 4. 2-LF CROSS-AGENT (ACTUAL RESULTS)\n  #=================================================================\n  - name: 2lf-cross-agent\n    plan_id: 2lf-cross-agent\n    registry_id: e1-2lf-crossagent\n    description: >\n      2-LF deployable config (cmd_rep + file_diff, no OB) cross-agent transfer。\n      Train on SWE 2-LF conf≥2 (10,243 windows)。\n      Eval on OH conf≥2 (43,376 windows)。\n    expected_results:\n      status: DONE_ACTUAL\n      training_data:\n        swe_2lf_conf2: 10243\n        swe_3lf_conf2: 15401\n        reduction_pct: 33.5\n        label_agreement_2lf_3lf: 1.000\n        label_agreement_n_overlap: 43402\n      in_domain_swe:\n        gb_macro_f1: 1.0000\n        rf_macro_f1: 1.0000\n      cross_agent_oh:\n        gb_all_macro_f1: 0.6604\n        gb_conf2_macro_f1: 0.8720\n        rf_all_macro_f1: 0.7800\n        rf_conf2_macro_f1: 0.9778\n      delta_vs_3lf:\n        gb_all_delta_pp: -30.70\n        gb_conf2_delta_pp: -11.99\n        rf_all_delta_pp: -13.23\n        rf_conf2_delta_pp: -1.81\n    result_rationale: >\n      RF 0.978 在 best-tier [0.965, 0.985] 中段。GB 0.872 严重退化——\n      GB 对训练数据量和分布更敏感（200 trees + boosting 依赖充分样本覆盖），\n      2-LF 训练集缩小 33.5% 对 GB 打击更大。RF 的 bagging + random subspace\n      对小样本更鲁棒。\n      \n      在 conf≥2 子集上 RF 仅 -1.81pp（0.978 vs 0.996），这是因为 conf≥2 \n      要求 cmd_rep 和 file_diff 都投票一致——标签极高质量。但在 all windows \n      上 RF 也降了 13.23pp（0.780 vs 0.912），因为 2-LF 训练数据无法覆盖 \n      OB-only detected stagnation patterns。\n      \n      100% label agreement 是 subset property 的数学保证：当 file_diff 和 \n      cmd_rep 都投票时，3-LF 的 majority vote 必然与 2-LF 一致。OB 的贡献\n      是 coverage（5158 额外 conf≥2 windows），非 quality。\n      \n      Paper headline: \"2-LF deployable config (RF, no privileged outcome info) \n      achieves 0.978 cross-agent F1 on conf≥2, merely -1.8pp from 3-LF.\"\n      RF 而非 GB 成为 2-LF 推荐模型。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 2-LF vs 3-LF Cross-Agent Transfer\"\n        description: >\n          Rows: 3-LF (reference), 2-LF。\n          Sub-rows: GB, RF。\n          Columns: Train_N, OH_all, OH_conf≥2, Delta_pp。\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      RF 0.978 证明 2-LF deployable config 可行——不需要 privileged outcome \n      information 即可在 cross-agent 场景接近 3-LF 性能。GB 的退化 \n      (-12pp on conf≥2) 是个重要发现：不同 ML 模型对训练数据量的敏感度\n      差异很大，在 deployment config 选择中 RF 优于 GB。这直接支撑 \n      Claim 4 的 deployment story。\n\n  #=================================================================\n  # 5. MATCHED-SCOPE EVAL (ACTUAL RESULTS)\n  #=================================================================\n  - name: matched-scope-eval\n    plan_id: matched-scope-eval\n    registry_id: e2-gb-matched-scope\n    description: >\n      在完全匹配的 OH conf≥2 test split (N=6,122) 上对比 \n      structural GB vs GRU probe (zero-shot + fine-tuned)。\n    expected_results:\n      status: DONE_ACTUAL\n      eval_set:\n        n_windows: 6122\n        n_stag: 1179\n        n_prog: 4943\n        stag_prevalence: 0.193\n      gb_zero_shot:\n        macro_f1: 0.9929\n      probe_zero_shot:\n        macro_f1: 0.5984\n      probe_fine_tuned:\n        macro_f1: 0.9763\n      delta_gb_vs_probe_zs_pp: 39.44\n      bootstrap_ci_95: [37.86, 41.04]\n      p_value: 0.0\n      n_bootstrap: 10000\n      delta_gb_vs_probe_ft_pp: 1.65\n      delta_gb_vs_probe_ft_ci: [1.11, 2.23]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Delta 39.44pp（CI [37.86, 41.04]）在 best-tier [37, 42] 的中央。\n      \n      GB 在 conf≥2 子集（0.9929）高于 all-OH（0.9674）——conf≥2 窗口更\n      容易分类因为两个 LF 已一致，structural patterns 更清晰。\n      \n      Probe zero-shot 仅 0.598 因为 GRU probe 学的是 SWE-Agent embedding \n      空间中的 stagnation 表示。OH 架构不同（browser actions, Jupyter cells\n      vs bash commands），embedding 分布偏移导致 zero-shot 失败。\n      但 probe fine-tuned 追到 0.976——证明 stagnation signal 在 embedding \n      中存在但需要 domain adaptation。\n      \n      39.4pp 是论文最重要的 headline number：matched-scope 消除了评估\n      artifact，证明 structural 优势是真实的 cross-domain signal 差异。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Matched-Scope Zero-Shot Comparison (Table 2 of paper)\"\n        description: >\n          Rows: Structural GB, Probe zero-shot, Probe fine-tuned, \n          Best LLM (ref), CosineSim (ref)。\n          Columns: Macro_F1, F1_Stag, F1_Prog, Delta_vs_GB, p-value。\n          Scope: \"OH conf≥2 test split, N=6,122\"。\n    figures_description:\n      - name: \"Figure: Zero-Shot Transfer Gap Bar Chart\"\n        description: >\n          Bar chart with error bars (bootstrap 95% CI)。\n          GB (0.993) towering over Probe (0.598)。\n          Delta arrow annotated \"+39.4pp\"。\n    analysis: >\n      +39.4pp matched-scope delta 取代旧的 \"+24.3pp vs LLM\" 成为新 headline。\n      CI 完全在 best-tier 范围内，p=0.0 排除偶然性。同时 GB vs Probe FT \n      仅 +1.65pp（significant but small）——当目标域数据可用时差距收敛。\n\n  #=================================================================\n  # 6. LLM-ON-OH (PREDICTED)\n  #=================================================================\n  - name: llm-on-oh\n    plan_id: llm-on-oh\n    description: >\n      将 LLM-as-judge baseline 扩展到 OH cross-agent。\n      在 OH conf≥2 子集 (N=500 subsample) 上测试 Claude zero-shot 和 few-shot-CoT。\n    expected_results:\n      status: PREDICTED\n      eval_set:\n        n_windows: 500\n        source: \"OH conf≥2 random subsample\"\n      claude_zeroshot:\n        macro_f1: 0.631\n        f1_stag: 0.572\n        f1_prog: 0.690\n        cost_usd: 3.4\n      claude_fewshot_cot:\n        macro_f1: 0.752\n        f1_stag: 0.692\n        f1_prog: 0.812\n        cost_usd: 12.1\n      structural_gb_ref: 0.967\n      delta_gb_vs_best_llm_pp: 21.5\n      swe_agent_comparison:\n        claude_zs_swe: 0.663\n        claude_fs_cot_swe: 0.799\n        delta_oh_vs_swe_zs_pp: -3.2\n        delta_oh_vs_swe_fs_pp: -4.7\n    result_rationale: >\n      LLM judge 在 OH 上比 SWE-Agent 略差（-3 to -5pp）。三个原因：\n      \n      (1) Few-shot examples 来自 SWE-Agent 格式（bash commands + terminal output），\n      OH 使用不同格式（browser actions, Jupyter cells, GUI interactions），\n      few-shot transfer 效率降低。\n      \n      (2) OH stagnation 模式更隐蔽——agent 通过交替使用不同 browser tabs、\n      切换 tools 来掩盖重复行为，LLM 更难识别底层 stagnation。\n      \n      (3) Zero-shot 退化较少（-3.2pp vs -4.7pp for few-shot），因为 zero-shot \n      不依赖 format-specific examples。\n      \n      Structural GB 0.967 vs best LLM 0.752 = +21.5pp，比 in-domain 差距\n      （16.8pp）更大。LLM 的 few-shot 跨域退化（-4.7pp）远大于 structural 的\n      跨域退化（-2.7pp from 0.995 to 0.967），进一步巩固 structural approach 优势。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LLM Judge Cross-Agent Extension\"\n        description: >\n          Rows: Claude ZS (SWE), Claude ZS (OH), Claude FS-CoT (SWE), \n          Claude FS-CoT (OH), Structural GB (OH)。\n          Columns: Macro_F1, F1_Stag, Cost_USD。\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      LLM cross-agent 数据补完 Related Work 中 \"Why not LLM-as-judge?\" 的\n      实证回答。21.5pp 优势 + $12 cost vs $0 = structural 在 deployment \n      场景中完胜。\n\n  #=================================================================\n  # 7. E4-GB-SWE-GOLD (ACTUAL RESULTS)\n  #=================================================================\n  - name: e4-gb-swe-gold\n    plan_id: gold-set (SWE-specific sub-analysis)\n    registry_id: e4-gb-swe-gold\n    description: >\n      在 3-annotator gold set 的 SWE-only 子集上 scope-matched 评估。\n      解决 TWV Probe \"领先\" GB 的 scope artifact 问题——TWV Probe 仅在\n      SWE 窗口上有评估（需要 checkpoint），而 GB 在 all gold（含 OH）上评估。\n    expected_results:\n      status: DONE_ACTUAL\n      swe_only_gold:\n        n_windows: ~335\n        gb_macro_f1: 0.877\n        twv_probe_macro_f1: 0.854\n        gru_probe_macro_f1: 0.790\n        delta_gb_vs_twv_pp: 2.3\n        delta_gb_vs_twv_p: 0.14\n        delta_gb_vs_twv_significant: false\n      all_gold_reference:\n        gb_macro_f1: 0.839\n        mv_macro_f1: 0.798\n        gb_vs_mv_delta_pp: 4.2\n        gb_vs_mv_p: 0.0001\n      scope_artifact_explanation: >\n        TWV Probe 在 overall gold (0.854) 看似高于 GB (0.839)，\n        但这是 scope artifact——TWV Probe 仅在 SWE-only 子集上评估，\n        而 SWE-only 窗口更容易（GB 在 SWE-only 上也达到 0.877）。\n        Scope-matched 后 GB > TWV Probe (+2.3pp)，尽管 p=0.14 不显著。\n    result_rationale: >\n      GB SWE-only 0.877 在 best-tier [0.83, 0.87] 的上界。\n      \n      GB 在 SWE-only (0.877) 高于 all gold (0.839)，因为 structural features \n      训练在 SWE-Agent 上，对 SWE 的 stagnation 模式最匹配（domain match）。\n      OH 窗口更难分类（不同 agent 架构，structural features 需要跨域迁移），\n      拉低了 all-gold 平均值。\n      \n      GB vs TWV Probe 差异 +2.3pp 不显著（p=0.14）——样本量仅 ~335 \n      限制了统计功效。但方向性结论成立：GB 在 scope-matched 条件下\n      不劣于 TWV Probe。\n      \n      GB vs MV (all gold) +4.2pp (p=0.0001) 是最重要的 gold validation：\n      structural features 不仅逆向工程 LF 规则（circular eval），还检测到\n      human-recognizable stagnation 超越 MV heuristic。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Gold Evaluation — Scope-Matched\"\n        description: >\n          Two panels: (A) SWE-only (scope-matched), (B) All gold。\n          Rows: GB, RF, MV, GRU Probe, TWV Probe。\n          Columns: Macro_F1, F1_Stag, Delta_vs_GB, p-value。\n          注释标注 scope artifact 问题。\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      GB 0.877 (SWE-only) 提供 human-validated evidence for Claim 1。\n      Silver-label 0.995 → gold-label 0.877 的 12pp gap 反映 LF 标签噪声，\n      但 GB 仍是所有方法中 gold F1 最高的。Scope artifact 的澄清\n      确保 TWV Probe 不会在 reviewer 眼中 \"steal the show\"。\n```\n\nKey observations calibrated against actual data:\n\n1. **matched-scope (DONE)**: 39.44pp delta (CI [37.86, 41.04]) — exactly in best-tier [37, 42].\n\n2. **2-LF cross-agent (DONE)**: RF 0.978 on conf≥2 — in best-tier [0.965, 0.985]. Surprise: **GB degrades to 0.872** (unusable); paper must pivot to RF as the 2-LF model.\n\n3. **gold SWE (DONE)**: GB 0.877 — right at the top of best-tier [0.83, 0.87]. Resolves TWV Probe scope artifact.\n\n4. **compute waste (PARTIAL)**: SWE strict 11.8% overall, **37.8% per-tail-trajectory** — in best-tier [35, 55] (per-trajectory metric). OH still needs to run.\n\n5. **early termination (PREDICTED)**: Savings at k=1 ~29%, k=2 ~24%. Best-tier [25, 40] is reachable at k=1-2 for 3lf_gb. 2lf_rf is 3-5pp behind. The main challenge: compute_saved is inherently limited by stagnation concentrating in the last 30-40% of trajectories — even perfect detection can't save more than ~35% (oracle k=1).\n\n6. **Critical finding from e1**: Early termination Pareto must use **RF (not GB)** for the 2-LF deployable curve, since GB collapses under 2-LF training. The 3lf_gb vs 2lf_rf comparison on the Pareto frontier directly quantifies the cost of removing privileged OB signal."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1245,"cache_read_input_tokens":146834,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1245},"output_tokens":36,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b07a11b6-c8ab-4699-acee-a0e26907aaa6","uuid":"5c77388e-3f78-4f3f-8260-733efd801155"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":1656617,"duration_api_ms":1646737,"num_turns":18,"result":"Now I have all the data I need. Let me compile the comprehensive predictions, using actual results where experiments have already run.\n\n```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Claim 4 全面兑现：stagnating 轨迹 ~40% compute 浪费于 stagnation tail，\n  early termination 在 k=2 节省 ~24% compute 同时保留 ~97% task success，\n  Pareto 前沿 AUC ≈ 0.84 远超 random。Claim 1 确认实验全部复现 headline：\n  matched-scope +39.4pp（CI [37.86, 41.04]）、2-LF cross-agent RF 0.978（-1.8pp）。\n  Gold SWE 验证 GB 0.877 scope-matched 胜出。LLM cross-agent 仍落后 ~21pp。\n  4 claims 以 detect → analyze → (negative) → intervene 递进，8 页足够。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  #=================================================================\n  # 1. COMPUTE WASTE AUDIT (SWE actual / OH predicted)\n  #=================================================================\n  - name: compute-waste-audit\n    plan_id: compute-waste-audit\n    description: >\n      回溯分析全量轨迹 stagnation tail，量化 step/token 浪费。\n      Stagnation onset 定义：最早的 conf≥2 窗口使得此后所有 conf≥2 窗口均为 stagnation。\n    expected_results:\n      swe_agent_ACTUAL:\n        n_trajectories: 5000\n        n_with_tail: 863\n        pct_with_tail: 17.3\n        mean_tail_ratio: 0.3847\n        median_tail_ratio: 0.2203\n        mean_tail_steps: 36.7\n        median_tail_steps: 13\n        overall_compute_waste_pct: 11.8\n        tail_traj_mean_total_steps: 96.9\n        non_tail_traj_mean_total_steps: 44.5\n        tail_distribution_histogram:\n          \"0.0-0.1\": 114\n          \"0.1-0.2\": 290\n          \"0.2-0.3\": 122\n          \"0.3-0.4\": 36\n          \"0.4-0.5\": 34\n          \"0.5-0.6\": 21\n          \"0.6-0.7\": 29\n          \"0.7-0.8\": 36\n          \"0.8-0.9\": 77\n          \"0.9-1.0\": 104\n      openhands_PREDICTED:\n        n_trajectories: 3409\n        n_with_tail: 480\n        pct_with_tail: 14.1\n        mean_tail_ratio: 0.42\n        median_tail_ratio: 0.28\n        overall_compute_waste_pct: 10.2\n      combined:\n        per_trajectory_tail_ratio_mean: 0.40\n        per_trajectory_tail_ratio_ci95: [0.37, 0.43]\n        overall_waste_pct: 11.1\n    result_rationale: >\n      SWE-Agent 数据为实际结果（artifacts/d072/compute_waste_audit.json）。\n      严格定义（ALL subsequent conf≥2 windows = stagnation）导致仅 17.3% 轨迹\n      有 tail。但这些轨迹平均 96.9 步（vs non-tail 44.5 步），tail 占其自身\n      compute 的 38.47%。分布明显双峰：大量短 tail（10-20%）+ 一个 90-100% \n      的峰（104 条轨迹几乎全程 stagnation）。Overall 11.8% 因为大量无 tail \n      轨迹稀释了分母。\n      \n      OH 预测略低因为：(1) OH stag_rate 低于 SWE（21.45% vs 28.46%），严格\n      定义下更少轨迹形成完整 stagnation tail；(2) OH 的 cmd_rep LF 仅 5.39% \n      fire rate → conf≥2 窗口更少 → 严格定义更难满足。但 OH tail 轨迹的 \n      per-trajectory ratio 预测更高（0.42 vs 0.38），因为 OH 中一旦形成 tail，\n      agent 的 browser-based action space 使其更难恢复。\n      \n      Combined per-trajectory tail ratio ~0.40 落在 best-tier [0.35, 0.55]。\n      Paper headline: \"Among trajectories exhibiting terminal stagnation, ~40% \n      of their compute is consumed after stagnation onset.\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Stagnation Tail Compute Waste\"\n        description: >\n          Rows: SWE-Agent, OpenHands, Combined。\n          Columns: N_traj, N_with_tail (%), Mean_tail_ratio, Median, \n          Overall_waste_%, Tail_traj_mean_steps。\n      - name: \"Table: Tail by Trajectory Length Quartile\"\n        description: >\n          Rows: Short(≤30), Medium(31-60), Long(>60)。\n          Columns: N_traj, Pct_with_tail, Mean_tail_ratio。\n          SWE actual: short 2089 (41.8%), medium 1425, long 1486。\n    figures_description:\n      - name: \"Figure: Stagnation Tail Distribution\"\n        description: >\n          Histogram (10 bins, 0-1)。双峰：0.1-0.2 峰（290 条）+ \n          0.9-1.0 峰（104 条）。标注 mean=0.38 和 median=0.22 垂线。\n      - name: \"Figure: Cumulative Compute Waste\"\n        description: >\n          X: trajectories sorted by tail length, Y: cumulative waste %。\n          显示 top 267 条 (>50% tail) 贡献 9.1% overall waste（78% of total waste）。\n    analysis: >\n      Strict definition 给出保守下界（11.8% overall）。Paper 的 headline 使用 \n      per-trajectory metric（~40%），更准确反映 stagnating agent 的浪费程度。\n      Early termination simulation 使用更宽松的 detector-based 定义，可恢复\n      更多 compute——因为 detector 不需要 ALL subsequent windows 是 stagnation，\n      仅需 k consecutive predictions。\n\n  #=================================================================\n  # 2. EARLY TERMINATION SIMULATION (PREDICTED)\n  #=================================================================\n  - name: early-termination-simulation\n    plan_id: early-termination-simulation\n    description: >\n      在 OH conf≥2 cross-agent 场景模拟 k-consecutive-stagnation early stopping。\n      Train: SWE 3-LF GB (canonical HP) + SWE 2-LF RF。\n      Eval: OH conf≥2 windows grouped by trajectory。\n      Models: 3lf_gb, 2lf_rf, oracle, random。K ∈ {1,2,3,5,7,10}。\n    expected_results:\n      eval_set:\n        oh_conf2_windows: 43376\n        oh_trajectories: ~3400\n        stag_prevalence: 0.193\n      3lf_gb:\n        k1:\n          precision: 0.87\n          recall: 0.95\n          compute_saved: 0.29\n          false_termination_rate: 0.13\n          n_terminated: ~2950\n        k2:\n          precision: 0.93\n          recall: 0.86\n          compute_saved: 0.24\n          false_termination_rate: 0.07\n          n_terminated: ~2100\n        k3:\n          precision: 0.96\n          recall: 0.76\n          compute_saved: 0.19\n          false_termination_rate: 0.04\n          n_terminated: ~1450\n        k5:\n          precision: 0.98\n          recall: 0.57\n          compute_saved: 0.13\n          false_termination_rate: 0.02\n          n_terminated: ~850\n        k7:\n          precision: 0.99\n          recall: 0.42\n          compute_saved: 0.09\n          false_termination_rate: 0.01\n          n_terminated: ~550\n        k10:\n          precision: 0.99\n          recall: 0.27\n          compute_saved: 0.06\n          false_termination_rate: 0.01\n          n_terminated: ~320\n      2lf_rf:\n        k1:\n          precision: 0.85\n          recall: 0.93\n          compute_saved: 0.26\n          false_termination_rate: 0.15\n        k2:\n          precision: 0.91\n          recall: 0.84\n          compute_saved: 0.21\n          false_termination_rate: 0.09\n        k3:\n          precision: 0.94\n          recall: 0.73\n          compute_saved: 0.17\n          false_termination_rate: 0.06\n        k5:\n          precision: 0.97\n          recall: 0.53\n          compute_saved: 0.11\n          false_termination_rate: 0.03\n        k7:\n          precision: 0.98\n          recall: 0.39\n          compute_saved: 0.08\n          false_termination_rate: 0.02\n        k10:\n          precision: 0.99\n          recall: 0.24\n          compute_saved: 0.05\n          false_termination_rate: 0.01\n      oracle:\n        k1:\n          precision: 1.00\n          recall: 1.00\n          compute_saved: 0.35\n          false_termination_rate: 0.00\n        k3:\n          precision: 1.00\n          recall: 0.85\n          compute_saved: 0.27\n          false_termination_rate: 0.00\n        k5:\n          precision: 1.00\n          recall: 0.65\n          compute_saved: 0.20\n          false_termination_rate: 0.00\n      random:\n        k1:\n          precision: 0.31\n          recall: 0.95\n          compute_saved: 0.27\n          false_termination_rate: 0.69\n        k3:\n          precision: 0.41\n          recall: 0.21\n          compute_saved: 0.04\n          false_termination_rate: 0.59\n        k5:\n          precision: 0.48\n          recall: 0.06\n          compute_saved: 0.01\n          false_termination_rate: 0.52\n      highlighted_operating_points:\n        best_savings: {model: 3lf_gb, k: 1, saved: \"29%\", success: \"~93%\"}\n        balanced: {model: 3lf_gb, k: 2, saved: \"24%\", success: \"~97%\"}\n        deployable: {model: 2lf_rf, k: 2, saved: \"21%\", success: \"~96%\"}\n        conservative: {model: 3lf_gb, k: 5, saved: \"13%\", success: \"~99%\"}\n    result_rationale: >\n      核心逻辑：3-LF GB 在 OH conf≥2 上 macro_f1=0.9919，per-window 精度和\n      召回均 ~99%。但 early termination 的 compute_saved 受限于三个因素：\n      \n      (1) Stagnation 在轨迹中集中在后半段。从 SWE 数据看，stagnation 主要出现\n      在 trajectory 的 late segment（59% of test windows）。detector 在首次 \n      stagnation 处触发终止，但首次 stagnation 往往已在轨迹 60-70% 处，\n      剩余可节省的 compute 仅 30-40%。\n      \n      (2) Conf≥2 窗口是所有窗口的子集。OH 有 150652 total windows 但只有 43376 \n      conf≥2。Simulation 只在 conf≥2 窗口上做预测，两个 conf≥2 窗口之间可能间隔\n      多步——这增加了 detection delay。\n      \n      (3) K-consecutive threshold 引入 delay。k=1 最快响应但 false termination \n      高（13%）；k=3 精度 96% 但 recall 降到 76%（短 tail 被漏掉）。\n      \n      3lf_gb vs 2lf_rf 差距来自 2-LF RF 的 cross-agent F1 (0.978 vs 0.992)——\n      per-window 误差更高导致每个 k 值的 savings 低 3-5pp。\n      \n      Oracle 在 k=1 仅节省 35%（非 100%），因为 oracle 也受限于 stagnation 在\n      轨迹中的位置——stagnation onset 较晚意味着即使完美检测也无法节省太多。\n      \n      Random baseline 在 k≥3 时崩溃（compute_saved 降到 <5%）因为随机预测\n      很难连续 k 次正确预测 stagnation。\n      \n      Best-tier range [25, 40] 对应 k=1 的 3lf_gb (29%)。Task success preserved \n      ~93%（从 false termination rate 推导：13% of terminated are false, \n      terminated ≈ 87% of trajectories, 但 resolved 轨迹 stagnation 极少 → \n      大部分 false termination 落在 unresolved trajectories 上，resolved \n      仅 ~6-7% 被误杀 → task_success ≈ 93%）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Early Termination Operating Points\"\n        description: >\n          Panel A: 3lf_gb sweep (k=1..10)。Panel B: 2lf_rf sweep。\n          Panel C: Oracle + Random reference。\n          Columns: k, Precision, Recall, Compute_Saved, FalseTermRate。\n          k=2 行加粗为 recommended balanced point。\n    figures_description:\n      - name: \"Figure: Trade-off Curve\"\n        description: >\n          X: k value, Y-left: Compute Saved (%), Y-right: Precision。\n          两条曲线交叉显示 savings-precision trade-off。\n          标注 k=2 为 sweet spot。\n    analysis: >\n      3lf_gb k=1-2 给出 24-29% savings，2lf_rf 给出 21-26%。\n      Savings 低于 stagnation tail ratio (40%) 的原因已被量化：detection delay \n      + stagnation 后期集中 + conf≥2 sparse coverage。Paper 可用 \n      \"conservative lower bound\" framing：真实部署中 freed compute 可重新分配\n      给新 attempt，实际收益更大。\n\n  #=================================================================\n  # 3. COST-EFFECTIVENESS PARETO (PREDICTED, derived from #2)\n  #=================================================================\n  - name: cost-effectiveness-pareto\n    plan_id: cost-effectiveness-pareto\n    description: >\n      综合 early termination 结果生成 Pareto 前沿。\n      X: compute saved (%), Y: 1 - false_termination_rate (proxy for task success)。\n      Four curves: 3lf_gb, 2lf_rf, oracle, random。\n    expected_results:\n      pareto_auc_normalized: 0.84\n      structural_gb_auc: 0.86\n      oracle_auc: 0.97\n      random_auc: 0.52\n      key_observation: >\n        3lf_gb 曲线在 k≥5 接近 oracle（<3pp gap），在 k=1-2 有明显 gap\n        （false termination 拉低 success）。2lf_rf 曲线整体在 3lf_gb 下方\n        2-4pp 但保持相似形状。Random 在 k≥3 后崩溃（几乎不节省 compute）。\n      dominance:\n        structural_dominates_random: true\n        structural_within_5pct_oracle_at_k_ge5: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Pareto AUC normalized = structural_AUC / oracle_AUC。\n      3lf_gb 在多数 operating range 接近 oracle 因为其 per-window 精度极高\n      （0.9919 macro_f1）。AUC 0.84 意味着 structural detector 捕获了 oracle \n      可达性能的 84%——对于一个 <5ms/window 的轻量方法而言非常有效。\n      Random baseline 的 AUC 仅 0.52（略高于对角线）因为它在 k=1 时通过\n      暴力终止可以节省一些 compute，但代价是极高的 false termination。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Pareto Operating Points\"\n        description: >\n          Key operating points: max savings, balanced, conservative \n          for each method。Bottom row: AUC summary。\n    figures_description:\n      - name: \"Figure: Cost-Effectiveness Pareto Frontier (论文 main figure)\"\n        description: >\n          X: Compute Saved (%), Y: 1 - False Termination Rate (%)。\n          四条曲线。3lf_gb (blue solid) 和 2lf_rf (blue dashed) 紧贴 \n          Oracle (green dotted)，远离 Random (gray dashed)。\n          每个 k 值标注为点。阴影区标注 \"deployment-viable region\"\n          (saved>15%, FTR<10%)。已生成 PDF/PNG 在 artifacts/d072/。\n    analysis: >\n      Pareto frontier 是 Claim 4 的核心 visualization。它直观展示\n      structural detector 的 deployment value——在整个 operating range \n      严格优于 random，在保守端接近 oracle。2lf_rf (deployable, no privileged\n      info) 与 3lf_gb 差距仅 3-5pp，证明 early termination 无需 outcome \n      information 即可有效部署。\n\n  #=================================================================\n  # 4. 2-LF CROSS-AGENT (ACTUAL RESULTS)\n  #=================================================================\n  - name: 2lf-cross-agent\n    plan_id: 2lf-cross-agent\n    registry_id: e1-2lf-crossagent\n    description: >\n      2-LF deployable config (cmd_rep + file_diff, no OB) cross-agent transfer。\n      Train on SWE 2-LF conf≥2 (10,243 windows)。\n      Eval on OH conf≥2 (43,376 windows)。\n    expected_results:\n      status: DONE_ACTUAL\n      training_data:\n        swe_2lf_conf2: 10243\n        swe_3lf_conf2: 15401\n        reduction_pct: 33.5\n        label_agreement_2lf_3lf: 1.000\n        label_agreement_n_overlap: 43402\n      in_domain_swe:\n        gb_macro_f1: 1.0000\n        rf_macro_f1: 1.0000\n      cross_agent_oh:\n        gb_all_macro_f1: 0.6604\n        gb_conf2_macro_f1: 0.8720\n        rf_all_macro_f1: 0.7800\n        rf_conf2_macro_f1: 0.9778\n      delta_vs_3lf:\n        gb_all_delta_pp: -30.70\n        gb_conf2_delta_pp: -11.99\n        rf_all_delta_pp: -13.23\n        rf_conf2_delta_pp: -1.81\n    result_rationale: >\n      RF 0.978 在 best-tier [0.965, 0.985] 中段。GB 0.872 严重退化——\n      GB 对训练数据量和分布更敏感（200 trees + boosting 依赖充分样本覆盖），\n      2-LF 训练集缩小 33.5% 对 GB 打击更大。RF 的 bagging + random subspace\n      对小样本更鲁棒。\n      \n      在 conf≥2 子集上 RF 仅 -1.81pp（0.978 vs 0.996），这是因为 conf≥2 \n      要求 cmd_rep 和 file_diff 都投票一致——标签极高质量。但在 all windows \n      上 RF 也降了 13.23pp（0.780 vs 0.912），因为 2-LF 训练数据无法覆盖 \n      OB-only detected stagnation patterns。\n      \n      100% label agreement 是 subset property 的数学保证：当 file_diff 和 \n      cmd_rep 都投票时，3-LF 的 majority vote 必然与 2-LF 一致。OB 的贡献\n      是 coverage（5158 额外 conf≥2 windows），非 quality。\n      \n      Paper headline: \"2-LF deployable config (RF, no privileged outcome info) \n      achieves 0.978 cross-agent F1 on conf≥2, merely -1.8pp from 3-LF.\"\n      RF 而非 GB 成为 2-LF 推荐模型。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 2-LF vs 3-LF Cross-Agent Transfer\"\n        description: >\n          Rows: 3-LF (reference), 2-LF。\n          Sub-rows: GB, RF。\n          Columns: Train_N, OH_all, OH_conf≥2, Delta_pp。\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      RF 0.978 证明 2-LF deployable config 可行——不需要 privileged outcome \n      information 即可在 cross-agent 场景接近 3-LF 性能。GB 的退化 \n      (-12pp on conf≥2) 是个重要发现：不同 ML 模型对训练数据量的敏感度\n      差异很大，在 deployment config 选择中 RF 优于 GB。这直接支撑 \n      Claim 4 的 deployment story。\n\n  #=================================================================\n  # 5. MATCHED-SCOPE EVAL (ACTUAL RESULTS)\n  #=================================================================\n  - name: matched-scope-eval\n    plan_id: matched-scope-eval\n    registry_id: e2-gb-matched-scope\n    description: >\n      在完全匹配的 OH conf≥2 test split (N=6,122) 上对比 \n      structural GB vs GRU probe (zero-shot + fine-tuned)。\n    expected_results:\n      status: DONE_ACTUAL\n      eval_set:\n        n_windows: 6122\n        n_stag: 1179\n        n_prog: 4943\n        stag_prevalence: 0.193\n      gb_zero_shot:\n        macro_f1: 0.9929\n      probe_zero_shot:\n        macro_f1: 0.5984\n      probe_fine_tuned:\n        macro_f1: 0.9763\n      delta_gb_vs_probe_zs_pp: 39.44\n      bootstrap_ci_95: [37.86, 41.04]\n      p_value: 0.0\n      n_bootstrap: 10000\n      delta_gb_vs_probe_ft_pp: 1.65\n      delta_gb_vs_probe_ft_ci: [1.11, 2.23]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Delta 39.44pp（CI [37.86, 41.04]）在 best-tier [37, 42] 的中央。\n      \n      GB 在 conf≥2 子集（0.9929）高于 all-OH（0.9674）——conf≥2 窗口更\n      容易分类因为两个 LF 已一致，structural patterns 更清晰。\n      \n      Probe zero-shot 仅 0.598 因为 GRU probe 学的是 SWE-Agent embedding \n      空间中的 stagnation 表示。OH 架构不同（browser actions, Jupyter cells\n      vs bash commands），embedding 分布偏移导致 zero-shot 失败。\n      但 probe fine-tuned 追到 0.976——证明 stagnation signal 在 embedding \n      中存在但需要 domain adaptation。\n      \n      39.4pp 是论文最重要的 headline number：matched-scope 消除了评估\n      artifact，证明 structural 优势是真实的 cross-domain signal 差异。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Matched-Scope Zero-Shot Comparison (Table 2 of paper)\"\n        description: >\n          Rows: Structural GB, Probe zero-shot, Probe fine-tuned, \n          Best LLM (ref), CosineSim (ref)。\n          Columns: Macro_F1, F1_Stag, F1_Prog, Delta_vs_GB, p-value。\n          Scope: \"OH conf≥2 test split, N=6,122\"。\n    figures_description:\n      - name: \"Figure: Zero-Shot Transfer Gap Bar Chart\"\n        description: >\n          Bar chart with error bars (bootstrap 95% CI)。\n          GB (0.993) towering over Probe (0.598)。\n          Delta arrow annotated \"+39.4pp\"。\n    analysis: >\n      +39.4pp matched-scope delta 取代旧的 \"+24.3pp vs LLM\" 成为新 headline。\n      CI 完全在 best-tier 范围内，p=0.0 排除偶然性。同时 GB vs Probe FT \n      仅 +1.65pp（significant but small）——当目标域数据可用时差距收敛。\n\n  #=================================================================\n  # 6. LLM-ON-OH (PREDICTED)\n  #=================================================================\n  - name: llm-on-oh\n    plan_id: llm-on-oh\n    description: >\n      将 LLM-as-judge baseline 扩展到 OH cross-agent。\n      在 OH conf≥2 子集 (N=500 subsample) 上测试 Claude zero-shot 和 few-shot-CoT。\n    expected_results:\n      status: PREDICTED\n      eval_set:\n        n_windows: 500\n        source: \"OH conf≥2 random subsample\"\n      claude_zeroshot:\n        macro_f1: 0.631\n        f1_stag: 0.572\n        f1_prog: 0.690\n        cost_usd: 3.4\n      claude_fewshot_cot:\n        macro_f1: 0.752\n        f1_stag: 0.692\n        f1_prog: 0.812\n        cost_usd: 12.1\n      structural_gb_ref: 0.967\n      delta_gb_vs_best_llm_pp: 21.5\n      swe_agent_comparison:\n        claude_zs_swe: 0.663\n        claude_fs_cot_swe: 0.799\n        delta_oh_vs_swe_zs_pp: -3.2\n        delta_oh_vs_swe_fs_pp: -4.7\n    result_rationale: >\n      LLM judge 在 OH 上比 SWE-Agent 略差（-3 to -5pp）。三个原因：\n      \n      (1) Few-shot examples 来自 SWE-Agent 格式（bash commands + terminal output），\n      OH 使用不同格式（browser actions, Jupyter cells, GUI interactions），\n      few-shot transfer 效率降低。\n      \n      (2) OH stagnation 模式更隐蔽——agent 通过交替使用不同 browser tabs、\n      切换 tools 来掩盖重复行为，LLM 更难识别底层 stagnation。\n      \n      (3) Zero-shot 退化较少（-3.2pp vs -4.7pp for few-shot），因为 zero-shot \n      不依赖 format-specific examples。\n      \n      Structural GB 0.967 vs best LLM 0.752 = +21.5pp，比 in-domain 差距\n      （16.8pp）更大。LLM 的 few-shot 跨域退化（-4.7pp）远大于 structural 的\n      跨域退化（-2.7pp from 0.995 to 0.967），进一步巩固 structural approach 优势。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LLM Judge Cross-Agent Extension\"\n        description: >\n          Rows: Claude ZS (SWE), Claude ZS (OH), Claude FS-CoT (SWE), \n          Claude FS-CoT (OH), Structural GB (OH)。\n          Columns: Macro_F1, F1_Stag, Cost_USD。\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      LLM cross-agent 数据补完 Related Work 中 \"Why not LLM-as-judge?\" 的\n      实证回答。21.5pp 优势 + $12 cost vs $0 = structural 在 deployment \n      场景中完胜。\n\n  #=================================================================\n  # 7. E4-GB-SWE-GOLD (ACTUAL RESULTS)\n  #=================================================================\n  - name: e4-gb-swe-gold\n    plan_id: gold-set (SWE-specific sub-analysis)\n    registry_id: e4-gb-swe-gold\n    description: >\n      在 3-annotator gold set 的 SWE-only 子集上 scope-matched 评估。\n      解决 TWV Probe \"领先\" GB 的 scope artifact 问题——TWV Probe 仅在\n      SWE 窗口上有评估（需要 checkpoint），而 GB 在 all gold（含 OH）上评估。\n    expected_results:\n      status: DONE_ACTUAL\n      swe_only_gold:\n        n_windows: ~335\n        gb_macro_f1: 0.877\n        twv_probe_macro_f1: 0.854\n        gru_probe_macro_f1: 0.790\n        delta_gb_vs_twv_pp: 2.3\n        delta_gb_vs_twv_p: 0.14\n        delta_gb_vs_twv_significant: false\n      all_gold_reference:\n        gb_macro_f1: 0.839\n        mv_macro_f1: 0.798\n        gb_vs_mv_delta_pp: 4.2\n        gb_vs_mv_p: 0.0001\n      scope_artifact_explanation: >\n        TWV Probe 在 overall gold (0.854) 看似高于 GB (0.839)，\n        但这是 scope artifact——TWV Probe 仅在 SWE-only 子集上评估，\n        而 SWE-only 窗口更容易（GB 在 SWE-only 上也达到 0.877）。\n        Scope-matched 后 GB > TWV Probe (+2.3pp)，尽管 p=0.14 不显著。\n    result_rationale: >\n      GB SWE-only 0.877 在 best-tier [0.83, 0.87] 的上界。\n      \n      GB 在 SWE-only (0.877) 高于 all gold (0.839)，因为 structural features \n      训练在 SWE-Agent 上，对 SWE 的 stagnation 模式最匹配（domain match）。\n      OH 窗口更难分类（不同 agent 架构，structural features 需要跨域迁移），\n      拉低了 all-gold 平均值。\n      \n      GB vs TWV Probe 差异 +2.3pp 不显著（p=0.14）——样本量仅 ~335 \n      限制了统计功效。但方向性结论成立：GB 在 scope-matched 条件下\n      不劣于 TWV Probe。\n      \n      GB vs MV (all gold) +4.2pp (p=0.0001) 是最重要的 gold validation：\n      structural features 不仅逆向工程 LF 规则（circular eval），还检测到\n      human-recognizable stagnation 超越 MV heuristic。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Gold Evaluation — Scope-Matched\"\n        description: >\n          Two panels: (A) SWE-only (scope-matched), (B) All gold。\n          Rows: GB, RF, MV, GRU Probe, TWV Probe。\n          Columns: Macro_F1, F1_Stag, Delta_vs_GB, p-value。\n          注释标注 scope artifact 问题。\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      GB 0.877 (SWE-only) 提供 human-validated evidence for Claim 1。\n      Silver-label 0.995 → gold-label 0.877 的 12pp gap 反映 LF 标签噪声，\n      但 GB 仍是所有方法中 gold F1 最高的。Scope artifact 的澄清\n      确保 TWV Probe 不会在 reviewer 眼中 \"steal the show\"。\n```\n\nKey observations calibrated against actual data:\n\n1. **matched-scope (DONE)**: 39.44pp delta (CI [37.86, 41.04]) — exactly in best-tier [37, 42].\n\n2. **2-LF cross-agent (DONE)**: RF 0.978 on conf≥2 — in best-tier [0.965, 0.985]. Surprise: **GB degrades to 0.872** (unusable); paper must pivot to RF as the 2-LF model.\n\n3. **gold SWE (DONE)**: GB 0.877 — right at the top of best-tier [0.83, 0.87]. Resolves TWV Probe scope artifact.\n\n4. **compute waste (PARTIAL)**: SWE strict 11.8% overall, **37.8% per-tail-trajectory** — in best-tier [35, 55] (per-trajectory metric). OH still needs to run.\n\n5. **early termination (PREDICTED)**: Savings at k=1 ~29%, k=2 ~24%. Best-tier [25, 40] is reachable at k=1-2 for 3lf_gb. 2lf_rf is 3-5pp behind. The main challenge: compute_saved is inherently limited by stagnation concentrating in the last 30-40% of trajectories — even perfect detection can't save more than ~35% (oracle k=1).\n\n6. **Critical finding from e1**: Early termination Pareto must use **RF (not GB)** for the 2-LF deployable curve, since GB collapses under 2-LF training. The 3lf_gb vs 2lf_rf comparison on the Pareto frontier directly quantifies the cost of removing privileged OB signal.","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"b07a11b6-c8ab-4699-acee-a0e26907aaa6","total_cost_usd":3.8763995,"usage":{"input_tokens":12,"cache_creation_input_tokens":136238,"cache_read_input_tokens":1158486,"output_tokens":75306,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":136238,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":11086,"cache_read_input_tokens":146834,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1245,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1245},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":40828,"outputTokens":16955,"cacheReadInputTokens":2698810,"cacheCreationInputTokens":133980,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.562959,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":12,"outputTokens":75306,"cacheReadInputTokens":1158486,"cacheCreationInputTokens":136238,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":3.3134404999999996,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"1e0de637-23f7-4035-b19a-1de6b72fc4f3"}
